{"id":"70a766967e154039","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-lem-chain-preservation.md","title":"Chain Preservation","display":"lem-chain-preservation — Chain Preservation","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-chain-preservation","aliases":["58-lem-chain-preservation"],"display":"lem-chain-preservation — Chain Preservation","depends_on":["[[58-df-ctm]]","[[58-df-name]]","[[58-df-ccc]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]","[[58-df-forcing-relation]]","[[58-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-chain-preservation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-chain-preservation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-chain-preservation — Chain Preservation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"58-df-ctm\">58-df-ctm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"58-df-name\">58-df-name</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"937fc0dd4cc72948\" href=\"?note=937fc0dd4cc72948\" title=\"58-df-ccc\">58-df-ccc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset\">58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"46b2495f214783c3\" href=\"?note=46b2495f214783c3\" title=\"58-df-forcing-relation\">58-df-forcing-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,P,\\leq_P,1_P,\\omega_1^M,\\check{\\omega_1^M}\\in V\">\\(M,P,\\leq_P,1_P,\\omega_1^M,\\check{\\omega_1^M}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTM}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CTM}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CCC}\">\\(\\mathrm{CCC}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\)</span> are the typed predicates from the dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-}\\)</span> is the fixed membership-language theory ZFC without Power Set</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{\\omega_1}(v_0)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\in}^{(1)}\">\\(\\varphi_{\\omega_1}(v_0)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\in}^{(1)}\\)</span> is a fixed formula saying that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span> is the least uncountable ordinal</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}chain\\text{-}preservation} \\vdash \\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-})\\land P,\\leq_P,1_P,\\omega_1^M,\\check{\\omega_1^M}\\in M\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\\land\\mathrm{CCC}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\check{\\omega_1^M},P)\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\!\\left(M,1_P,\\varphi_{\\omega_1},\\langle\\check{\\omega_1^M}\\rangle,P,\\leq_P\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}chain\\text{-}preservation} \\vdash \\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-})\\land P,\\leq_P,1_P,\\omega_1^M,\\check{\\omega_1^M}\\in M\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\\land\\mathrm{CCC}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\check{\\omega_1^M},P)\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\!\\left(M,1_P,\\varphi_{\\omega_1},\\langle\\check{\\omega_1^M}\\rangle,P,\\leq_P\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The formula code, ground model, top condition, name tuple, carrier, and order are explicit; the conclusion says that c.c.c. forcing preserves the ground model's <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> as the extension's <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ctm","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ctm]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-name","status":"resolved","id":"ec28b62254928d73","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-name]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ccc","status":"resolved","id":"937fc0dd4cc72948","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ccc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-forcing-relation","status":"resolved","id":"46b2495f214783c3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-forcing-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df